Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John",
    "username": "test1",
    "password": "[PASSWORD]"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test1",
    "password": "[PASSWORD]"
}